            <div xml:id="d586">

                <pb facs="0738" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg626"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 612.119/1261</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fletcher</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-18T14:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 18, 1918, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>979. Plan outlined by Federal Reserve Board in your 981, April 17, 7 p.m., seems
                    desirable and feasible and meets with my approval.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
